ages 1-1; unnumbered paragraph 1","sha256":"ba5a4c923ec4b275dc41479b661892364fc7c188eb537d33a413f08476abcdef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1950-03-24/pdf/FR-1950-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10117#p1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"I hereby create a board of \nthree members, to be appointed by me, \nto investigate the said dispute. No mem­\nber of the said board shall be pecuniarily \nor otherwise interested in any organiza­\ntion of railway employees or any carrier.\nThe board shall report its findings to \nthe President with respect to the said \ndispute within thirty days from the date \nof this order.\nAs provided by section 10 of the Rail­\nway Labor Act, as amended, from this \ndate and for thirty days after the board \nhas made its report to the President, no \nchange, except by agreement, shall be \nmade by the carriers represented by the \nWestern Carriers’ Conference Commit­\ntee, or their employees in the conditions \nout of which the said dispute arose.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"15 FR 1653, PDF pages 1-1; unnumbered paragraph 2","sha256":"ba5a4c923ec4b275dc41479b661892364fc7c188eb537d33a413f08476abcdef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1950-03-24/pdf/FR-1950-03-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10117#p2","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"15 FR 1653, PDF pages 1-1","sha256":"ba5a4c923ec4b275dc41479b661892364fc7c188eb537d33a413f08476abcdef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1950-03-24/pdf/FR-1950-03-24.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 2 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:10117"}
